# Docs layout

- Entry: root `AGENTS.md` → map in `docs/README.md`.
- Spec: `docs/SRS.md` · Status: `docs/PROGRESS.md`.
- Why: `docs/decisions/` (ADR) · Shape: `docs/architecture/` · Feature design: `docs/design/`.
- Working memory: `docs/notes/` · Session bridge: `docs/handoffs/` · Prompt seeds: `docs/prompts/`.
- Do not invent new top-level `docs/` folders without updating `docs/README.md` and `AGENTS.md`.
